msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... A-Arf... Arf..."
msgstr "…あ、あふん…ふん…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... And that was how I broke up with my latest boytoy."
msgstr "…そして、それが私の最新のボーイトイと別れた経緯だった。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... B-but?"
msgstr "…で、でも？"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Hah..."
msgstr "...はぁ……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "... Honestly I have no idea, dear. I just know she liked coming here and curling up on the ledge. Maybe it was the view... or the smells."
msgstr "…正直、私にもさっぱり分からないわ。ただ、彼女がここに来て、手すりの上に丸くなるのが好きだったってことだけ知ってる。景色が良かったから…？それとも匂いのせいだったのかしら…？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... I think so!"
msgstr "…そう思う！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "... I... Perhaps."
msgstr "…私…そうかもね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Interesting. I haven't seen anyone crack open one of those suitcases before. It seems you're not a complete failure after all."
msgstr "…興味深いな。あのスーツケースを開ける人間なんて、今まで見たことがない。どうやら、お前も完全に無能というわけではなかったようだな。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Let's agree to never do something like this again."
msgstr "…もう二度とこんなことはしない、ってことで合意しよう。"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>... M-mhmmm...</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>…ん、んんん……</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... M-mhmmm..."
msgstr "…ん、んんん……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... Nope."
msgstr "...ううん。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... Please... play with me more... ma'am..."
msgstr "…もっと…私と遊んでください…お嬢様…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Please?"
msgstr "…お願い？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Proceed."
msgstr "…進め。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Right."
msgstr "…そうね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... Right..."
msgstr "…そうね…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Riiiiight..."
msgstr "…そう…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Shit."
msgstr "…クソ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Whole lotta nothin'."
msgstr "…何もないってことさ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... Yeah. You were sitting on it the whole time."
msgstr "…そう。ずっとそれの上に座ってたんだな。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "... Yeah..."
msgstr "…そうね…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... Yes?"
msgstr "…ええ？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "... Yes? But- You didn't tell me why the spirits are-"
msgstr "…え？でも…なんで精霊たちが…って、教えてくれなかったじゃないか…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "... or not."
msgstr "…あるいは、違うのか？（話し手：執行官、男性）"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "... upward..."
msgstr "…上へ…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "...! I-... I- wont-...! Khh..."
msgstr "…！わ…私…やらない…！っ…（話者：ゾーイ、女性）"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...- so he said, yeah. Installed new cameras too."
msgstr "…って、そう言ってたよ。新しいカメラも設置したってさ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Brad"
msgid "...Did any of my neighbors see you going down there?"
msgstr "…近所の誰かに、お前が下りていくところを見られたりはしなかったか？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...I'm glad."
msgstr "…よかった。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...Something's wrong but I can't prove it."
msgstr "…何かがおかしいけど、証明できない。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...Thanks, by the way. For what you did before..."
msgstr "…ところで、ありがとう。さっきのこと、本当に…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...Thanks, by the way. For yesterday..."
msgstr "…そういえば、ありがとう。昨日のこと…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...Why do you talk like that, though?"
msgstr "…なんでそんな話し方するの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "...Yes. That is my fetish. And public display of a fetish is only punishable with a warning."
msgstr "…ええ。それが私のフェティッシュです。それに、フェティッシュを公に披露したとしても、罰せられるのは警告だけですよ。"

