msgstr "それに…チップは本当に、結構な頻度で嬉しいお小遣いになってくれるんだから！～"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "And don't forget about my offer, hehe."
msgstr "それと、私の提案も忘れないでね、へへっ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Lio"
msgid "And done! Eheh. Sorry you had to see that, Zoey."
msgstr "完了！エヘッ。それを見せちゃってごめん、ゾーイ。（話し手：リオ、男性）"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And here, I've got your device ready. I modified a custom dildo I was working on. Attached a Neo-Faraday cage at the tip."
msgstr "ほら、君のデバイスも準備できたよ。今まで作ってたカスタムディルドを改造して、先端にネオ・ファラデーケージを取り付けたんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And hey- Uh... You shouldn't have to feel... scared to be seen either. Just saying. I get it too."
msgstr "それに…えっと…見られることを怖がる必要なんてないはずだよ。ただ言ってみただけ。私もわかるから。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And hurry up, I don't have all day."
msgstr "急いでよ、一日中待ってられるわけないんだから。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Lio"
msgid "And if you don't, you're screwed. Ugh. Fuck me, alright Zoey. Just lemme see what I can do. Give me a minute."
msgstr "そうしないと、お前は終わりだ。うっ…クソッ、分かったよ、ゾーイ。ちょっと考えさせてくれ。少し時間をくれ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And it'd take me fucking months of work to afford that."
msgstr "それを手に入れるには、クソ長い時間をかけて働かなきゃならないんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And it's really not extra?"
msgstr "本当に余計じゃないの？"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And just like the surrounding wasteland"
msgstr "そして、周囲の荒れ地と同じように"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And let us hear yours~"
msgstr "じゃあ、あなたの声を聞かせてよ～"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And miss out on this rare bit of free time with my bestie? I can afford being late for you, Z!"
msgstr "私の親友とのこの貴重な自由時間を逃すわけにはいかないでしょ？あなたのためなら遅刻くらい、別にいいわよ、Z！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And next time you'll help me think of something fun we can do together."
msgstr "そして次回は、一緒に何か楽しいことを考え出すのを手伝ってくれるんだね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Lio"
msgid "And now you need me to make a fake of it? Why?"
msgstr "じゃあ今、それを偽物で作ってほしいってこと？なんで？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And she didn't even take it. Just get outa here, girl."
msgstr "しかも彼女は受け取ってもいない。さっさと出ていけ、お嬢さん。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And since I don't imagine you can actually pay me for the work, I need you to take these while I fix up your little gadget."
msgstr "それに、君が本当に仕事の対価を払えるとは思えないから、私が君の小さなガジェットを修理している間、これを受け取ってもらわないと。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And so has she~"
msgstr "彼女もそうよ〜"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And that got him thrown out?"
msgstr "それで追い出されたって？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And that was enough to get you thrown out?"
msgstr "それだけで追い出されたっていうの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "And that would be..."
msgstr "それって…"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And the drone was recording?"
msgstr "ドローンも録音してたの？"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And the purple stuff?"
msgstr "それ、紫のやつは？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And then Zoey said, let there be light... bridge."
msgstr "そしてゾーイが言った。「光あれ……」橋。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And there are these ancient spirits heading here that are evil, right?"
msgstr "それに、ここに向かってくる古代の悪霊もいるんでしょ？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And they go after the citizens for loitering... So hypocritical..."
msgstr "しかも市民を徘徊で捕まえるなんて…なんて偽善者たちなんだ…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And those stinking guards haven't even noticed us yet!"
msgstr "しかも、あの臭い衛兵たちもまだ俺たちに気づいてないぞ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And time for you to make new memories too, Leona."
msgstr "それなら、レオナも新しい思い出を作る時だね。"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>And um... some... other things...</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>それと、ええと…その…他のことも…</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "And um... some... other things..."
msgstr "それと、ええと…その…他のことも…"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And we didn't leave?"
msgstr "俺たちは出て行かなかったのか？"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And we haven't watched them yet?"
msgstr "まだ彼らを見てないの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And we just wanted to get a closer look at your little kitty here, Leona. What was her name? Felicia?"
msgstr "それに、君のこの子猫ちゃんをもう少し近くで見たかっただけなんだ、レオナ。彼女の名前は何て言ったっけ？フェリシア？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "And when yah' done, gimme a good sniff of ya nasty little asshole, ahaha! 'Pay whaeva tip ya want, ahaha!"
msgstr "終わったら、その汚いケツの匂いをよーく嗅がせてくれよ、あはは！チップは好きなだけ払ってくれればいいぜ、あはは！（話し手：トロフ、男性）"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And where do you think you are going?"
msgstr "一体どこへ行くつもりなの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And where do you think you're going?!"
msgstr "一体どこへ行くつもりなのよ！？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And where is Mynx anyways?!"
msgstr "で、Mynxは一体どこにいるのよ？！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "And where is this contact?"
msgstr "で、その連絡先はどこにいるの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And where the fuck do you think you're going, huh?"
msgstr "一体どこへ行くつもりなんだ、ふん？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "And who is this? Some online girlfriend?"
msgstr "で、こいつは誰？ネット上の彼女か何か？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And who would that be?"
msgstr "それは誰のこと？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "And without your fB card... you..."
msgstr "それに、あなたのfBカードがなければ…あなたは…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And yet it still looks better than anything I could put together."
msgstr "それでも、私が用意できるどんな服よりもずっと素敵に見えるわ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And yet, here you are. Posing for me like a good little bunny."
msgstr "それでも、ここにいるのね。いい子ちゃんみたいに、私のためにポーズして。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And yet, you can still see it in her eyes.. The unease. The taboo she was all so scared of. She"
msgstr "それでもなお、彼女の瞳にはそれが見て取れる……不安。彼女があれほど恐れていたタブーが。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Varen"
msgid "And yet... I might part with ten more fuckbucks if you revealed your bare chest to me."
msgstr "それでも…君が裸の胸を晒してくれたら、俺はさらに10フックバックスは払ってもいいかもしれないな。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "And you don't know how to open it?"
msgstr "それを開ける方法も知らないの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And you obeyed. That's good. Let that reality sink into your bones. You can lie to yourself all you like, but I see that hunger in you."
msgstr "そして、あなたは従った。それは良いことだ。その現実を骨の髄まで浸透させなさい。好きなだけ自分を騙していても構わないが、私にはあなたの中のその渇望が見えている。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "And you really think you're any better than them?"
msgstr "じゃあ、あんたが本当にあいつらよりマシだと思ってんの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And you're Zoey. The new waitress, hmm? Didn't we get interrupted while I was showing you the... ropes... recently?"
msgstr "それで、君はゾーイ。新しいウェイトレス、かな？この間、私が君に…ここのやり方を…教えている途中で、中断されちゃったよね？"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <size=23>And you're forgetting to behave like a decent human being...
#. rich_translation: <size=23>それに、まともな人間らしく振る舞うのも忘れているわね…
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "And you're forgetting to behave like a decent human being..."
msgstr "それに、まともな人間らしく振る舞うのも忘れているわね…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "And you're gonna watch~"
msgstr "それを、見てるんだからな～"

