msgid "Anyway, enjoy this bundle of items! We didn't have enough time to put them in a fancier place. Enjoy gooning, and drink water. - Vils"
msgstr "とにかく、このアイテムの束を楽しんで！もっと立派な場所に置く時間じゃなかったんだ。気持ちよくなるのも楽しんで、水も飲んでね。 — ヴィルス"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Anyway, if you're interested in doing an Xhibition Run, just come let me know. Oh-! I'm Exxy, by the way."
msgstr "とにかく、Xhibition Runに興味があるなら、いつでも教えて。あ、そうだ！俺はエクシーって言うんだ。"

