#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "It used to be nothing more than a charging plug. Thanks to new sensors however, I prefer the term \"emotional bonding device\"."
msgstr "かつては単なる充電プラグに過ぎなかった。だが新しいセンサーのおかげで、今では「感情結合デバイス」と呼ぶ方を好む。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "It was always so soothing... Listening to her purr would remind me of those days... Before everything..."
msgstr "いつもあんなに心地よかったんだ……彼女の喉音を聞いてると、あの頃を思い出す……すべてが変わる前の……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It was an accident! I just fell..."
