#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It was nothing. I had a good time."
msgstr "大したことないよ。楽しかったから。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "It was when I moved into the place I'm at now, dear. About a year ago. There were a few... well- unsavory people around. I just..."
