msgid "It's mostly about remembering what the customers order. If you can manage that, you're more than qualified!"
msgstr "基本的には客が注文したものを覚えることだけ。それができれば、あなたなら十分すぎるほど有能よ！"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>It's nasty...</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>気持ち悪い……</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's nasty..."
msgstr "気持ち悪い……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Varen"
msgid "It's nearly the same as last time."
msgstr "前回とほとんど同じだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's not a thingie! It's a vaginal-chip-removal device!"
msgstr "物じゃないわ！膣チップ除去装置よ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's not just about money, Z. Just you being here is helping keep my head above water too."
msgstr "お金だけの話じゃないの、Z。あなたがここにいるだけで、私もどうにかこうにか生きていけてるのよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's not like the landlord will stop making money just 'cause some girl died."
msgstr "大家が金儲けを止めるとは思えないけどな、女の子が一人死んだくらいで。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Cook"
msgid "It's not my fault! My wrist was glitching off again."
msgstr "私のせいじゃないわ！手首がまたフリーズしちゃったのよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's not-... This is all I get to see from her anymore."
msgstr "そうじゃない…これが、今や彼女から見える全てなんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's okay now, Auntie Sarah's here. I'm not gonna let 'em get ya."
msgstr "もう大丈夫よ、サラおばさんがいるから。あいつらに捕まらせたりしないわ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's okay! As long as we work together, we can do anything, bestie!"
msgstr "大丈夫！協力し合えば、何だってできるわよ、親友！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "It's okay! Look... maybe you could... T-tip me for- um... other... things..."
msgstr "大丈夫よ！ほら…もしかしたら…私に…えっと…他の…こと…でチップを…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's okay. Come on, bestie. Let's just get this stuff unpacked and we'll figure things out after you're moved in."
msgstr "大丈夫よ。ほら、親愛なる友よ。まずは荷物を解いて、君が引っ越したら、その後は考えよう。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's okay. I'm here. Let's just try to get some rest, okay, bestie?"
msgstr "大丈夫。私がいるから。とりあえず、少し休んでみない？親友さん。"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <size=25>It's okay... Just... Let's get this over with... for Felicia.</size>
#. rich_translation: <size=25>大丈夫…ただ…さっさと終わらせよう…フェリシアのために。</size>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's okay... Just... Let's get this over with... for Felicia."
msgstr "大丈夫…ただ…さっさと終わらせよう…フェリシアのために。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's pretty bad Zoey. The operating system is completely corrupted, and even some internals are fried. I don't think we're fixing this one."
msgstr "かなり深刻だ、ゾーイ。OSは完全に破損してるし、内部の一部も焼き切れてる。これはもう修理できないだろうな。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Salesman"
msgid "It's previous owner has of course brought it in to be upcycled instead of becoming landfill! So thoughtful of the environment, don't you think?"
msgstr "もちろん、前の持ち主がこれをアップサイクルのために持ってきたんですよ。埋立地になる代わりに！環境への配慮が素晴らしいと思いませんか？（セールスマン）"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's right here, this one will show you."
msgstr "ここにあるよ、これがそれだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Varen"
msgid "It's such a pleasure to be near you, young lady."
msgstr "お嬢さん、あなたのそばにいられるなんて、本当に幸せです。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's super simple, darling! Just squish your beautiful boobies a little and get a nice big tip for it, I'll show you exactly how, ehehe."
msgstr "超簡単よ、ダーリン！あなたの美しいおっぱいをちょっと押しつぶして、でっかいチップを手に入れるの。どうやるか、私がちゃんと教えてあげるわ、えへへ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "It's that girl I searched, heh. She's thoroughly clean. Let her pass."
msgstr "探してた子だ、へっ。完全に清浄だ。通してやれ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's the least we can do."
msgstr "我々がすべき最低限のことだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's too fucking old. Fixing that piece of shit would cost me almost as much as a new model."
msgstr "古すぎるんだよ、クソが。そのガラクタを修理するのにも、新品とほぼ同じくらい金がかかるんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "It's um... It's okay. I-... I'll get your drink now, Mira..."
msgstr "うん…大丈夫。今…今から飲み物持ってくるから、ミラ…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's up to you, Z. I trust you."
msgstr "君次第だよ、Z。信じてる。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "It's worth a shot. Let's see it."
msgstr "試す価値はある。見せてもらおうか。"

