msgstr "ううん、でも君は賢そうな子だもの。きっと解決できるわよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "No, it wasn't your fault, Z. It was just me. I fucked up, as usual..."
msgstr "ううん、あなたのせいじゃないわ、Z。私だけよ。いつものように、私がしくじっただけ…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "No, it's not. So you're going to have to lay low wherever you are. Stay out of the Redlight District until the lockdown is lifted."
msgstr "いや、違う。だから、今いる場所では目立たないようにするしかない。封鎖が解除されるまで、レッドライト地区には近づかないで。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "No, it's too dark."
msgstr "ううん、暗すぎる。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "No, it's... great! You look great! Just... take a girl out to dinner first or something!"
msgstr "ううん、いいのよ！すごく素敵よ！ただ…まずは女の子をディナーに連れて行ったりして！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "No, like really. He's totally hammered, you might want to check on him."
