msgctxt "ui"
msgid "No, no, no... I-... I'm s-so sorry... I-... I have to go... Aghh...!"
msgstr "いや、いや、いや……す、すまない……行、行かなきゃ……うっ……！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "No, no. Closer than that."
msgstr "いや、いや。もっと近くに来て。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "No, no. Too forward!"
msgstr "いや、いや。積極的すぎる！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "No, no... Shit. It's my fault, I... I shouldn't snap at you. Not you."
msgstr "いや、いや…クソ。俺のせいだ。俺は…お前にキレるべきじゃなかった。お前じゃない。"

