#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- They're- Just like that- In an alley- Wow-"
msgstr "おお—　彼らは—　まさにその調子で—　路地裏で—　わあ—"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh, yeah. See ya around then, Cypher."
msgstr "ああ…ええ、そう。じゃあ、また会おう、サイファー。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh- No! I- mean- Heh- I don't mean you're not- I mean- Eheh..."
msgstr "あ、えっと…違う！つまり…へへ、別にあなたのことを…じゃなくて、えへへ…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh- Thanks?"
msgstr "うっ…ええと…ありがとう？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh. Eheh- No problem!"
msgstr "うっ…えへへ、問題ないよ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh. Yeah. That's weird."
msgstr "うっ…ええ。おかしいわね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh... He's asking you on a date. Apparently he made eye contact with you one time."
msgstr "ああ…ええと…彼、君にデートを誘ってるんだ。どうやら一度、君と目が合ったことがあるみたいで。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Uh... I just did what had to be done to get you that battery."
msgstr "う、えっと…君にそのバッテリーを手に入れるために、やるべきことをやっただけだよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Oh- We don't have those either-"
msgstr "ああ——私たちもそんなもの持ってないのよ。（話し手：サラ、女性）"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Well I can't read too well, hun. What'd he say in it?"
msgstr "うーん…ええと、あんまり字が読めないのよ、ハニー。彼、何て書いてたの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Wow! The bed!"
msgstr "おお…！このベッド！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Yeah that's okay, Z. Sorry, I didn't mean to- I was just- Sorry. I've just been really worried about you, because..."
msgstr "ああ、うん、大丈夫だよ、Z。ごめん、そんなつもりじゃ…ただ…ごめん。ただ、あなたのことがすごく心配で、だって…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Yeah, I don't smoke anymore. Kicked it a while ago."
msgstr "うん、もう吸ってないよ。しばらく前にやめたんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Yeah, I think I already met her at the Glowing Hole."
msgstr "ああ、そうだな。確か、あの「グロウイング・ホール」で一度会ったことがあるはずだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- Yeah, that's okay."
msgstr "ああ、うん、大丈夫だよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- crap I think someone's lookin'. We gotta make our move now!"
msgstr "うわっ、まずい！誰かに見られてるみたいだ。今すぐ行動しないと！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- heh, thanks!"
msgstr "おっ、へへ、ありがとう！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh- heh. No worries. I've uh... seen worse!"
msgstr "おっ…へへ。気にしないで。ええと…もっとひどいのも見たことあるから！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- o-okay... So-... Do I-"
msgstr "う、うん…じゃあ…私、"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- uh- Heh. I've got a request. Can we-"
msgstr "う、えっと……へへ。頼み事があるんだ。もしかして……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- uh... heh- thanks!"
msgstr "あ、えっと…へへ、ありがとう！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- wow."
msgstr "うわー…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh- years at least. Daddy got 'em for me way back when."
msgstr "ああ、もう何年もね。パパが昔、私にくれたのよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Max"
msgid "Oh-! ... Ohh... You know... I've never had a client complain about one either now that I think about it. Guess that's one good thing, huh?"
msgstr "ああ…うぅ…そういえば…今までクライアントから文句を言われたことなんて一度もなかったな。まあ、それくらいは良かったってことか？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Er-"
msgstr "おっ！えっと…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Heh- I uh- That's- I'm not-"
msgstr "あっ！…へへっ…えっと…それは…違うの…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Heh-..! Erm, thanks! It's all good..!"
msgstr "おおっ！へへっ…！えっと、ありがとう！全然平気だよ…！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! I can do that! N-No problem!"
msgstr "おおっ！それならできる！な…なんの問題もないよ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! I... Thanks!"
msgstr "あっ！…ありがとう！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh-! Okay!"
msgstr "ああ！わかった！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! That's... That sounds... nice?"
msgstr "おおっ！それは……それは……いい感じ？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Well, no. I haven't. I would've noticed her. Plus, she would've tripped one of my security systems."
msgstr "ああ！いや、見てない。気づいてたはずだ。それに、彼女なら私のセキュリティシステムの一つに引っかかってるはずだけど。"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-! Wow! That's- Wow!"
msgstr "おお！わあ！それは…わあ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-.. I-.. Sorry..! Don't mind me..!"
msgstr "ああ…す…すみません…！気にしないでください…！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-.. Right..! I'm on it!"
msgstr "あ、…そう！今やります！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-..! Sorry, I'm not here for drinks."
msgstr "あ、..！ごめん、お酒を飲みに来たわけじゃないの。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-..! Sorry..! I was going for the wrong door, heh! I- I'm coming!"
msgstr "おおっ…！ごめん…！間違ったドアに向かっちゃってたの、へへ！ま、もう行くから！"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Oh-... I see...</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>ああ…なるほど…</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh-... I see..."
msgstr "ああ…なるほど…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-... Uh... Th-thanks...!"
msgstr "ああ…えっと…あ、ありがとう…！"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Oh-? Um- thanks.</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>おお？えっと…ありがとう。</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh-? Um- thanks."
msgstr "おお？えっと…ありがとう。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh. Yeah, that sucks. Maybe you should take it to a technician?"
msgstr "うん。確かに最悪だな。技術者に持っていくとかどう？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh... I uhh-"
msgstr "うぅ…えっと…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Rosie"
msgid "Oh... My... God... You look amazing!"
msgstr "うわ……まじか……！すごく素敵！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh... Okay."
msgstr "うん…わかった。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Oh... Really...?"
msgstr "へぇ……本当……？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh... sweetheart... Come here..."
msgstr "ああ…ダーリン…こっちにおいで…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh... sweetie... Do you want to talk about it...?"
msgstr "うぅ……ダーリン……そのことについて話したいの……？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh... wow..."
msgstr "うわぁ……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh...- Uhm-... N-no! Sorry...!"
msgstr "うぅ…えっと…い、いや！ごめん…！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh? It's an old BF-75d. These were everywhere before the crisis!"
msgstr "おや？古いBF-75dじゃないか。危機以前はこれ、どこにでもあったのに！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Woman"
msgid "Oh? Tell us!"
msgstr "お？教えて！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Customer"
msgid "Ohh fuck those are some hot milkers, ahaha!"
msgstr "うわっ、クソ、こいつらマジでホットなミルクラーだな、あはは！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Customer"
msgid "Ohh fuck yes..., 'nything you say, babyy'! *hic*"
msgstr "ああ、クソ最高……！何でも言うわよ、ベイビー！*ヒク*"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohh right... *hic* haven't even introduced myself...*hic* name is Cody."
msgstr "ああ、そうだ… *ヒク* 自己紹介もしてなかったな…*ヒク* 俺の名前はコーディ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohh, okay. That's fine, you already helped me a lot with other stuff."
msgstr "うん、わかった。それならいいよ。他のことでも、もうたくさん助けてもらったし。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "Ohh-.. She sounds fun. I'll let her book me, hehe."
msgstr "おおっ…彼女は面白そうだな。彼女に予約させてもらうか、へへ。（話し手：Bunnyboy）"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohhh. Ohhh damn. Hey... *hic* hi there."
msgstr "うぅ……うぅ、ちくしょう。ねえ……*ヒク*、こんにちは。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohhh... *hic* you"
msgstr "ううっ… *ぐっ*…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohhh...! That sounds funn!"
msgstr "うわぁ……！それ、面白そう！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohhh~ fuck, fuck, fuck~ Yes~ Ooh~ Keep going~ Please~"
msgstr "ああ〜、クソ、クソ、クソ〜！そう〜、うぅ〜、止まらないで〜、そこよ、ベイビー〜"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohh~ Holy shit, look at you go~"
msgstr "うわぁ〜、マジかよ、見てみろよ〜"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohoho, just teasing, dear~ Look how red you are~!"
msgstr "おほほ、ただのからかいよ、あなた～ほら、顔が真っ赤になってるわ～！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ohohoh~ Look, Issac. Someone's taking pictures of us."
msgstr "オホホ〜ほら、アイザック。誰かが私たちの写真を撮ってるわ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh~ Eager for head, hm?"
msgstr "おお〜、頭を求めるとは、ええ？"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Oh~ Zoey~ You're soaked down here~"
msgstr "おお〜、ゾーイ〜、下の方、びしょ濡れじゃないか〜"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Oi, let's go quit screwin' around and find another charging station."
msgstr "おい、もうふざけやがって、別の充電ステーションを探しに行こうぜ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Okay darling, we're going to help you get a little more comfortable around me. You're going to go use my shower."
msgstr "いいの、ダーリン。私があなたをもう少しリラックスさせてあげるから。私のシャワーを浴びてきて。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, I think I found the right port. Move your leg a bit."
msgstr "よし、正しいポートは見つけたはずだ。足を少し動かしてくれ。"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Okay, I will.</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>うん、そうするよ。</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, I will."
msgstr "うん、そうするよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, I'll be right back with your order, sir."
msgstr "はい、ご注文品、すぐお持ちしますよ、お客様。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, I'll tell him..."
msgstr "うん、伝えておくわ……"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Okay, I-... I'll try...</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>う、うん……やってみる……</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, I-... I'll try..."
msgstr "う、うん……やってみる……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, I... I guess I can manage that."
msgstr "うん、わ、私なら、なんとかできると思う。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Okay, darling."
msgstr "うん、ダーリン。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Okay, dear..."
msgstr "うん、ハニー…"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Okay, fine-... So...</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>よし、わかったわ…じゃあ…</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, fine-... So..."
msgstr "よし、わかったわ…じゃあ…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, here. Take a look."
msgstr "よし、これだ。見てみて。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, it was my boyfriend who told me."
msgstr "うん、彼氏に言われて来たの。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay, no rush."
msgstr "うん、急がなくていいよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, now how do we..."
msgstr "よし、じゃあどうやって…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, okay."
msgstr "わかった、わかったよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, sounds good."
msgstr "うん、わかったよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay, well... Maybe you can ask Lio for help?"
msgstr "うーん…リオに助けを求めたらどうかな？"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Okay-... But... Don't make it obvious, okay?</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>分かったわ…でも…露骨にしすぎないで、ね？</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay-... But... Don't make it obvious, okay?"
msgstr "分かったわ…でも…露骨にしすぎないで、ね？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay. It's okay, Z. Sorry for bringing it up. Let's just... get these boxes unpacked, 'kay?"
msgstr "うん。大丈夫だよ、Z。その話を持ち出してごめん。とりあえず…この箱を片付けよう、ね？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay. It's okay, Zoey. You don't have to say anything. Don't worry. I'm here for you no matter what."
msgstr "うん。大丈夫だよ、ゾーイ。何も言わなくてもいいの。心配しないで。何があっても、私がそばにいるから。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... So you mentioned Felicia used to be an outdoor cat? How long ago was that?"
msgstr "なるほど……じゃあ、フェリシアが元々外で暮らしてた猫だったって話だけど？それっていつ頃のことだったんだ？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... always a pleasure, officers..."
msgstr "まあ……いつもご機嫌よう、警官さんたち……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... and what do those ones do...?"
msgstr "なるほど……で、あれはどんな効果があるの……？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... so now what?"
msgstr "なるほど……じゃあ、次は何？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay... so, I just... Start... washing...?"
msgstr "うーん……じゃあ、私、ただ……洗い始める……の？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Okay... touchy subject..."
msgstr "うーん……ちょっと触れられたくない話だけど……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Okay...? And how do I get it open?"
msgstr "なるほど……？じゃあ、どうやって開けるの？"

