msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Once it's lifted, wait for my call and I'll tell you when to bring it in. Got it?"
msgstr "封鎖が解かれたら、俺の電話を待ってろ。いつ持ってくるべきか教える。分かったか？"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ondine"
msgstr "オンディーヌ"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Rugnar"
msgid "One fifty."
msgstr "150だ。（スピーカー：ルグナー）"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "One hundred for the room and fifty for the service."
msgstr "部屋代で百、サービス代で五十。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "One hundred thousand? Are you out of your fucking mind?!"
msgstr "10万だと？　頭おかしいんじゃないのか！？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Rugnar"
msgid "One hundred. Handjob. Right here."
msgstr "100。ハンドジョブ。ここで。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "One of them had blue hair, just like you..."
msgstr "彼らの一人は青い髪をしていた…君と同じように…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Only a genius such as myself could have come up with such an elaborate plan! Now... what to write..."
msgstr "自分ほどの天才でなければ、これほど手の込んだ計画を思いつくことなどできやしない！さて…何を書こうか…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Only a little, huh? I meant the shower water. What did you mean?"
msgstr "ほんの少しだけ、って？シャワーの水のことだったのよ。あなたはどういう意味で言ったの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Only a vile woman like Klaudia would dare to stand in the way of our love. Once she heard what happened, she cast me out!"
msgstr "クラウディアのような卑劣な女でなければ、私たちの愛の邪魔などするはずがない。彼女が事の次第を聞くと、私を追い出してしまったのだ！"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Only in"
msgstr "Only in"

