msgid "Sorry for the wait, sir. Here's your Neon Lime!"
msgstr "お待たせいたしました、お客様。こちらがネオンライムでございます！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry won't cut it! You owe us!"
msgstr "謝って済む話じゃない！お前、借りがあるんだぞ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry! Just haven't had much time to dig in. Plus I'm more of an apple girl anyways."
msgstr "ごめん！ただ、食べる時間があまりなかったの。それに、どうせ私はリンゴ派だから。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry! Sorry!"
msgstr "ごめん！ごめん！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, I didn't mean to."
msgstr "ごめん、そういう意味じゃなかったの。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, I-.. I changed my mind.."
msgstr "ごめん、わ、私…考えを変えたの…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry, I-... I have to go."
msgstr "ごめん、わ、私、行かなきゃ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, I-... I know my arm looks weird."
msgstr "ごめん、私…私の腕が変に見えるのは分かってるんだけど。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, heh. Got another challenge for ya. We're looking for another high payout run. You think you can give us another big one?"
msgstr "すまない、へへ。もう一つ課題があるんだ。次はもっと高額な報酬が狙えるランを探してる。また大当たりを出せると思うかい？"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Sorry, it's just... your... you know- It looks very... <color=#EB83FF>realistic</color>...
#. rich_translation: すみません、ただ…あなたの…ほら…<color=#EB83FF>すごく…リアルに見えて…</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry, it's just... your... you know- It looks very... realistic..."
msgstr "すみません、ただ…あなたの…ほら…すごく…リアルに見えて…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry, um... Maybe another time!"
msgstr "ごめん、えっと…また今度！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Sorry-...! Didn't mean to pry."
msgstr "ごめん…！詮索するつもりはなかったの。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry. I'll get out of your hair."
msgstr "ごめん。もう邪魔しないから。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry... I just... can't."
msgstr "ごめん…ただ…無理。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry... I-... I didn't mean to-..."
msgstr "ごめん…わ、私…そんなつもりじゃ…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Mira"
msgid "Sorry...! I-... I didn't-... I don't-... Ahhh...!"
msgstr "ごめん…！わ、…わかってない……わかんない……あぁぁ…！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sorry? Hahaha. It just makes me want you in my lap that much more."
msgstr "ごめん？ハハハ。それならなおさら、君を膝の上に置きたい気分になるわ。"

