#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sup, Zoey! Here's your... totally legit blocker!"
msgstr "やあ、ゾーイ！ほら、これが君の…完全に合法的なブロッカーだよ！"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Super Plum"
msgstr "スーパープラム"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Super pivital moment. This is the first time she commits to a handjob and genuinely gives in to the pervert inside her."
msgstr "超重要な瞬間だ。彼女がハンドジョブに本気で応じ、内に秘めた変態性を完全に受け入れたのは、これが初めてだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Rosie"
msgid "Sure am! Excited for your first shift?"
msgstr "もちろん！初めてのシフト、楽しみ？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "Sure am. 200 bucks. You'll love my cock, bunny."
msgstr "当然さ。200ドルだ。俺のチンポ、気に入るぜ、バニー。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "Sure as fuck I will watch that little shithole of yours, mhhhh. Start thrusting your hips already."
msgstr "もちろん、そのクソったれな穴をちゃんと見てやるよ、んんん。さっさと腰を突き上げ始めろ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Sure do, darling. Was a custom job. Spending money for Felicia used to be one of my favorite activities back then."
msgstr "もちろんよ、ダーリン。オーダーメイドだったの。昔はフェリシアのためにお金を使うのが、一番好きなことの一つだったんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sure thing, officer."
msgstr "承知いたしました、警官さん。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sure thing. Say cheeese!"
msgstr "もちろんです。チーズ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sure thing. So what about my reward?"
msgstr "もちろんです。で、私の報酬はどうなるんですか？"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr "もちろん！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sure, I could use the money. Be back in a flash."
msgstr "なるほど、金ならいいけどな。すぐ戻るよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sure, I'll show you at my terminal!"
msgstr "いいよ、俺の端末で示してやる！"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Sure, I'm sure I'll find one...!</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>うん、きっと見つけられるって…！</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sure, I'm sure I'll find one...!"
msgstr "うん、きっと見つけられるって…！"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Sure, babe. Some customers will pay waitresses a nice tip for <i>personal</i> service, eheh. Maybe you should look into that.
#. rich_translation: 分かったわ、ハニー。一部の客はウェイトレスに<i>個人的なサービス</i>をしてもらえたら、いいチップをくれるものよ、えへへ。それも考えてみたらどう？
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sure, babe. Some customers will pay waitresses a nice tip for personal service, eheh. Maybe you should look into that."
msgstr "分かったわ、ハニー。一部の客はウェイトレスに個人的なサービスをしてもらえたら、いいチップをくれるものよ、えへへ。それも考えてみたらどう？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sure, see you when you're back at the building. - Coming!"
msgstr "うん、建物に戻ったらまた会おう。——今行く！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sure, whatever you say."
msgstr "いいよ、あなたの言う通りに。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sure, whatever."
msgstr "うん、わかったよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Sure... I don't wanna hurt you..."
msgstr "うん…あなたを傷つけたくないんだけど…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Woman"
msgid "Surely that guy will get us featured with that, ehehe!"
msgstr "あの人なら、これで間違いなく紹介されるわ、えへへ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Enforcer"
msgid "Surely, you're not travelling without a ticket, hm?"
msgstr "チケットなしで旅をするなんて、まさか？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "Surprised"
msgstr "驚いた"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Surprised by the squirting between her legs. Losing her cool for a moment, being too loud"
msgstr "彼女の太ももの間から噴き出す精液に驚き、一瞬冷静さを失い、声が大きくなりすぎた。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "Surprised? You really thought I wouldn't be able to piece it together, merc? You really need to learn how to cover your tracks."
msgstr "驚いた？本当に私がそれを組み立てられないと思っていたのか、傭兵？お前は本当に足跡を隠す方法を学ぶ必要があるな。"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Suspicious Concoction"
msgstr "怪しい調合"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Suspicious-... But-!"
msgstr "怪しい……でも！"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Suuuure~!"
msgstr "もちろん～！"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
