#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uggh! I really want long nails, but my girlfriend wants me to keep them short for... reasons... Ahh, the things I do for love..."
msgstr "うっ！本当に長い爪が欲しいけど、彼女は…理由があって短く保ってほしいのよ…。はぁ、愛のためなら何でもするわ…。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "Ugh fine... Move your ass up and down then, bitch. Give me a nice show!"
msgstr "うっ、わかったわ……じゃあ、ケツを上下に動かして、ビッチ。いいショーを見せてちょうだい！"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh!"
msgstr "うっ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh! Asshole!"
msgstr "うっ！クソ野郎！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh! Dream on. Are we done here?!"
msgstr "うっ！夢でも見てろ。もう終わりなの！？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "Ugh, FUCK you're hot, ahaha! Go fetch me a drink now."
msgstr "うっ、クソ、お前マジでセクシーだな、あはは！さあ、飲み物を持ってこいよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "Ugh, fine. I'll just spread your pretty asshole then, bitch."
msgstr "うっ、わかったよ。じゃあ、その綺麗なケツを広げてやるよ、クソアマ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh, just thinking about it makes my skin crawl. Come on, let's just keep unpacking, Z."
msgstr "うっ、考えるだけで肌が粟立つわ。ほら、とりあえず荷解きを続けよう、Z。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh. Same old, same old. Working for GAG is such a damn slog. Not like I want to work for them, but try telling your dad \"no\" when he's the fucking mayor."
msgstr "うっ。相変わらずだよ。GAGで働くなんて、マジで骨が折れる。別に彼らの下で働きたいわけじゃないけど、父親がクソ市長なのに「ノー」なんて言えるわけないだろ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh. What the heck! These guys are blocking the way."
msgstr "うっ、ちくしょう！こいつら、道を塞いでるじゃないか！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh... Alright. I'll try."
msgstr "うっ…わかった。やってみる。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh... And what am I supposed to do about the Cartel?"
msgstr "うっ…じゃあ、カルテルのこと、どうすればいいの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Ugh... But you're just not happy like this, are you? Even with how hard I try to pamper you..."
msgstr "うぅ……でも、このままじゃ全然満足してないんでしょ？私がどれだけ甘やかそうとしても……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Ugh... Felicia must've wandered home while those idiots were harassing us."
msgstr "うっ…フェリシアは、あのバカどもが私たちを妨害してる間に、家に帰っちゃったんだろうな。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh... It's still warm..."
msgstr "うっ…まだ温かい…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh... No, that's not it."
msgstr "うっ……いや、そうじゃない。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ugh... Sorry. I didn't mean to be an asshole."
msgstr "うっ…ごめん。意地悪するつもりはなかったんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Ugh... Yes... Sir..."
msgstr "うっ…はい…旦那様…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Ughhh! But you're alwaaays busy! When you gonna make some time for your bestie, huh?"
msgstr "ううっ！でも、あなたはいつも忙しいのよ！親友のために時間を作るのはいつになるの、え？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh huh."
msgstr "うん。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Uh huh. Zoey, dear. Get the lights please?"
msgstr "うん。ゾーイ、ダーリン。電気つけてくれる？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Uh oh! Looks like this bucket of bolts ran out of juice! Shame."
msgstr "うわっ！どうやらこのガラクタ、バッテリー切れみたいだな！残念だ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh- I'd rather not go out there. Can I just... stay here?"
msgstr "うっ…そこには出たくない。ただ…ここにいてもらえない？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh- No- That's just- That's spare parts!"
msgstr "うっ…いや、それはただの…スペアパーツだよ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh-.. Cal? Wait, what? Who's that?"
msgstr "うっ…カル？え、何？誰のこと？"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Uh-... R-right!</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>う、うん…そ、そうよ！</color>
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uh-... R-right!"
msgstr "う、うん…そ、そうよ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh-Uhm... Ca-Can I put some clothes on before I answer?"
msgstr "う、うーん……こ、服を少し着てから答えさせてもらえませんか？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh. Yeah! Put those super spy skills to work!"
msgstr "うん！その超スパイスキルを存分に発揮して！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh... *hic* sorry"
msgstr "うぅ… *ヒク* ごめん"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "Uh... Alright."
msgstr "う…わかった。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh... Calliach? Where are ya?"
msgstr "あの…カリアッハ？どこにいるの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh... How are we gonna get out of here?"
msgstr "うーん…ここからどうやって出ようか？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh... Sorry, Jaime. I didn't mean to offend."
msgstr "うぅ…ごめん、ジェイミー。悪気はなかったんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh... What are you gonna sleep on when you head home? Isn't this your bed, Sarah?"
msgstr "あの…家に帰ったら、何で寝るつもりなの？これ、サラのベッドじゃないの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uh... Yeah. No problem, Jaime. Talk later?"
msgstr "うん…ええ。問題ないわ、ジェイミー。また後で話そう？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uh... Yes?"
msgstr "うん…ええ？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uh... what's that picture on your screen?"
msgstr "うーん……その画面に映ってる絵は何？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh, okay-..! Sweet drink, huh?"
msgstr "うーん、わかったわ…！おいしい飲み物、ね？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh- Okay. I trust you! If you find my phone, I'll give you some fuckbucks for your troubles."
msgstr "うーん……わかったわ。信じてあげる！私の電話を見つけてくれたら、ご褒美にファックバックスをあげるわ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh- Seen who?"
msgstr "うっ… 誰を見たって？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh- Yeah! I can help if you want."
msgstr "うーん…うん！手伝ってあげたいなら、できるよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uhh- here doggy! Get the bone!"
msgstr "うっ…こっちだよ、わんこ！骨をもらって！"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh-! Nice tentacles!"
msgstr "うっ！いい触手だな！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh-! What... kinda price?"
msgstr "うっ！…どんな値段だって？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uhh..."
msgstr "うっ…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... Are you okay, Exxy?"
msgstr "うっ… エクシー、大丈夫？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... Hey. Are you alright?"
msgstr "うっ… あの、大丈夫？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... I can hear you two, you know..."
msgstr "うっ…二人とも聞こえてるんだぞ…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... What are we doing?"
msgstr "うーん……何をしてるの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... What's this for?"
msgstr "うっ……これ、何に使うの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... Where's Lio again?"
msgstr "うーん…リオって、どこだっけ？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... Where's what?"
msgstr "うーん……何のこと？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... Yeah! We're okay! The box went crazy on us."
msgstr "うっ…うん！大丈夫だよ！箱が暴走しただけだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... You wouldn't happen to have something that could help recharge an andro would you?"
msgstr "うーん……もしかして、アンドロの再充電に役立つようなもの、持ってたりしない？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhh... how are you gonna do that?"
msgstr "うーん……どうやってそれやるの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh! No! No one! She's my uh-"
msgstr "うっ！違う！誰でもない！彼女は私の、ええと…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh, Z. Look behind you."
msgstr "うーん、Z。後ろを見て。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh, something like that! Oh- I gotta go, let me know once you're close."
msgstr "う、うん、そんな感じ！あ、もう行かなきゃ。着いたら連絡してね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uhhh- Soon? I really gotta go-"
msgstr "うーん…すぐ？もう行かないと…（話し手：Zoey、女性）"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh- so far none! Still working on retention."
msgstr "うーん……今のところ一人もいない！まだ定着率を上げようとしてるところ。"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh- you too?"
msgstr "うっ……あなたも？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh. You doing okay, buddy?"
msgstr "うーん……大丈夫か、相棒？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh... Hello? Is this place open?"
msgstr "うーん…もしもし？ここ、営業してる？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh... I have no idea how this thing works..."
msgstr "うーん……これがどうやって動くのか、さっぱり分からない……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uhhh... I'm not taking anyone!"
msgstr "ううっ…誰とも付き合わないわ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uhhh... Okay Lio, I've got another key. Here goes nothing."
msgstr "うーん……わかったわ、リオ。鍵がもう一つ手に入ったわ。じゃあ、やってみるわ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh... Okay?"
msgstr "うーん……わかった？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uhhh... Well apparently it's the reason for the itch we've been feeling these past few years. This thing blocks it."
msgstr "うーん……どうやらそれが、ここ数年感じていたあの「かゆみ」の原因らしい。これがそれをブロックしてるんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh... good?"
msgstr "うーん……まあまあかな？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhhh... hello? Everything okay in here? It's me, Zoey!"
msgstr "うーん……もしもし？ここ、大丈夫？私よ、ゾーイ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhm, yeah!"
msgstr "うん、そうよ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhm, yeahh..."
msgstr "うーん、うん…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Uhm. Right. Soo..."
msgstr "うーん。そう。ええと…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhm... Excuse me?"
msgstr "うーん……失礼します？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhm... Hey, no touching, please."
msgstr "うーん…ねえ、触らないでよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhm... I had to take a picture of you while you were out... It was the only way I could get you the battery you needed."
msgstr "うーん…君がいない間に写真撮っちゃったんだ…そうするしか、君に必要なバッテリーを手に入れる方法がなかったから。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhm... Leona?"
msgstr "うーん……レオナ？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhm... Leona? You remember when we... you know... in front of those Vultures?"
msgstr "うーん……レオナ？あの……ほら、あのハゲタカたちの前で……のこと、覚えてる？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhm... No? I knew it was you already."
msgstr "うーん……いや？君だって分かってたよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Uhm... W-well..."
msgstr "うーん……え、ええと……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
