msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Y-you've seen enough!"
msgstr "見…見飽きたでしょ！"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "YAH"
msgstr "YAH"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "YALREADY KNOW"
msgstr "もう知ってるよ"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "YES"
msgstr "YES"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "YOU KNOW WHAT YOU DESERVE!"
msgstr "何がふさわしいか、わかってるのよ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "YOU made this choice, skank! You kneeled in the flesh! You knew exactly what it meant! You. Want. This."
msgstr "お前が選んだんだ、スケバン！自分の体で跪いたんだぞ！それが何を意味するか、分かってたんだろ！お前…これが…欲しいんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Ya hear this gutter trash?"
msgstr "この下品なガラクタ、聞こえるか？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Customer"
msgid "Ya'd make a killing if ye wanted, hah!"
msgstr "欲しいなら大金持ちになれるのに、はは！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yahaha! I found you."
msgstr "ヤハハ！見つけたぞ。"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yay!"
msgstr "やった！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yay!! I'll walk you through every step, honey!"
msgstr "やった！！全部一歩一歩案内してあげるわ、ハニー！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeaaah, true."
msgstr "うん、そうね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeaah, I chipped one of them when I went dumpster diving. I figured I'd stay with the tried and true. If it ain't broke, ya know?"
msgstr "うん、ゴミ箱漁りしてたら一つ欠けちゃったんだ。だから、いつもの色でいこうって。壊れてないなら、それでいいじゃん？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeaah~ That's it, cutie~ Mmm~ Your hands are so soft too~"
msgstr "うん〜 そうよ、可愛い子〜 んん〜 あなたの手もすごく柔らかいんだね〜"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah"
msgstr "うん"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah of course! You pay more rent than me anyways. But since when have you cared about your hair that much?"
msgstr "うん、もちろん！どうせ君の方が家賃を多く払ってるんだし。でも、いつからそんなに髪のこと気にするようになったんだ？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Yeah that's a good idea... Would you please help this old bird, Zoey? I... I don't know what I'd do without her. I'll make it worth your while!"
msgstr "うん、それはいい考えだわ……この年寄り鳥を助けてくれない？私……彼女がいなかったらどうすればいいか分からないの。ちゃんと報いてあげるから！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Trov"
msgid "Yeah that's right, eheheh. Get me a drink. I want to stare at your ass carrying my tips around."
msgstr "そうそう、えへへ。飲み物を持ってきてくれ。俺のチップを運んでるお前のケツをずっと見ていたいんだ。"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah we did do dat"
msgstr "うん、確かにやったよ"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah!"
msgstr "うん！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! And now the damn thing won't open. Can you help me?"
msgstr "うん！でも、今じゃこのクソったれなものが開かなくなっちまったんだ。手伝ってくれる？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! I'm a huge believer in crafting my own look. It lets me have my own personal aesthetic, you know?"
msgstr "うん！自分のルックを自分で作り上げるって、すごく信じてるんだ。そうすれば、自分だけのパーソナルな美学が持てるわけだし、わかる？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! Is that a push-up bra? Do you even need that?"
msgstr "うん！これプッシュアップブラ？そんなもの必要なの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! It's right there in the name, right? Everyone loves a gal who's not afraid to bare it all. Plus the pay's good."
msgstr "そうよ！名前からもわかるでしょ？みんな、何も隠さずにさらけ出す女の子が好きなの。それに、報酬もいいし。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! Jaime, Sarah. Sarah, Jaime."
msgstr "うん！ハイメ、サラ。サラ、ハイメ。"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! Talk-"
msgstr "うん！話そう—"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! Thanks for the help, officers! Heh..."
msgstr "うん！助けてくれてありがとう、警官さんたち！へへ…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! That woman strikes me as the type to keep the best for herself."
msgstr "そうだ！あの女は一番いいものを自分だけのために取っておくタイプに見える。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Woman"
msgid "Yeah! What's your name?"
msgstr "そうだ！君の名前は？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah! You'd love him, he's a treat. You got a hubby too?"
msgstr "うん！彼のこと、きっと気に入るわ。すごくいい人なの。あなたも旦那さんいるの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I don't know about this. You can deal with it yourself."
msgstr "うん、それはどうかな。自分で何とかできるでしょ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah, I figured. Didn't think a group calling themselves \"The Cartel\" would be good news."
msgstr "うん、そう思ったわ。「カルテル」なんて名前のグループが良い知らせだなんて、思ってもみなかった。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I got a transfer, but... The value is smaller than last time."
msgstr "うん、転送は受け取ったけど…価値が前回より低くなってる。"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Yeah, I got it!</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>うん、わかった！</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I got it!"
msgstr "うん、わかった！"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Yeah, I got them. Thanks. Am I ever glad to <i>not</i> go outside.
#. rich_translation: うん、受け取ったよ。ありがとう。外に出なくて本当に良かった。
#, rt-review
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I got them. Thanks. Am I ever glad to not go outside."
msgstr "うん、受け取ったよ。ありがとう。外に出なくて本当に良かった。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah, I guess that's me."
msgstr "うん、まあ、私ってことかな。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I know."
msgstr "うん、わかってる。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Max"
msgid "Yeah, I mean- it was just a little black thing. Barely covered the knockers, you know how it is. He wanted the big tiddies too."
msgstr "うん、つまり――ただの小さな黒いドレスだったの。胸はほとんど隠れてなかったし、わかるでしょ。彼も大きな胸が欲しかったみたいで。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I see! Wow, you really saved my synthetic bacon. Hey, whatever you girls want, you can have it. On the house."
msgstr "うん、わかったわ！わあ、本当に私の合成ベーコンを救ってくれたのね。ねえ、お前さんたちが欲しいものなら、何でもあげるわ。サービスよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah, I sorta figured."
msgstr "うん、まあ、なんとなくわかってたけど。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I'll go give it to her. Just gimme a minute, I'll be back."
msgstr "うん、彼女に渡しに行ってくる。ちょっとだけ待ってて、すぐ戻るから。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I'm a stunner."
msgstr "そうよ、私って魅力的なんだから。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah, I- I did get them in the end."
msgstr "うん、えっと…結局は手に入れたんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, I- uh... I'm almost there..."
msgstr "うん、こ、ここ……もうすぐ着く……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, Klaudia, um... she had one for me."
msgstr "うん、クラウディア、ええと…彼女は私のために一つ持ってたの。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, Zoey. Our business is with her, not you. So YOU back off, bitch."
msgstr "そうだ、ゾーイ。俺たちの相手は彼女だ、お前じゃない。だからお前は下がれ、クソ女。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, because he bent the knee immediately. He didn't even put up a shred of fight."
msgstr "ああ、だって彼はすぐにひざまずいたんだ。抵抗の気配すら見せなかった。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, but it's kinda funny in retrospect."
msgstr "うん、でも後から考えると、ちょっと面白いよね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, but not like this. Those guys are bad news."
msgstr "うん、でもこんな風じゃなくて。あいつらはヤバい奴らだから。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Yeah, but that's not something you can explain to a cat. She was antsy at first, but... I thought it was enough. That I was enough..."
msgstr "うん、でもそれは猫に説明できることじゃない。最初は落ち着かなかったけど…それで十分だと思ってた。自分が十分だって…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, don't feel like walkin' all the way outside today. Feeling kinda shitty lately. Must be under the weather."
msgstr "うん、今日は外まで歩く気になれないな。最近、なんだか気分が優れないんだ。風邪でもひいてるんだろうな。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, guess not. No big score for me. I'll be lucky if I even survive."
msgstr "うん、そうみたいね。私には大した儲けもないわ。生きて帰れれば御の字でしょう。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, he uh... wrote a letter for you."
msgstr "うん、彼が…ええと、君に手紙を書いてたんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Yeah, here... she used to like going to this... sketchy place."
msgstr "うん、ほら…彼女は昔、こういう…怪しい場所に行くのが好きだったの。"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Yeah, <color=#EB83FF>it looks really good</color>... I mean- good attention to detail!
#. rich_translation: うん、すごくよくできてるみたい…つまり、ディテールに凝ってるね！
#, rt-review
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, it looks really good... I mean- good attention to detail!"
msgstr "うん、すごくよくできてるみたい…つまり、ディテールに凝ってるね！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, it's just a Rogue relay node. Made my first one when I was 12."
msgstr "うん、ただのローグ中継ノードだよ。12歳の時に初めて作ったんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, just getting it fixed up right now. This is gonna take a while."
msgstr "うん、ちょうど今修理中なんだ。これには結構時間がかかりそう。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, me too, bestie."
msgstr "うん、私もよ、親友。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, me too... Do you think painkillers would work on it?"
msgstr "うん、私も…鎮痛剤が効くと思う？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, no worries."
msgstr "うん、気にしないで。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, not looking forward to that either."
msgstr "うん、それも楽しみじゃないな。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, see ya."
msgstr "うん、またね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, she has a gig pulling security there."
msgstr "うん、彼女はそこで警備の仕事をしてるんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, sure. I'll help you out."
msgstr "うん、わかった。手伝ってあげる。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, thanks! Easy fix."
msgstr "うん、ありがとう！簡単だったよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, thanks, Lio. You're awesome!"
msgstr "うん、ありがとう、リオ。最高だね！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, thanks, Lio. You're awesome."
msgstr "うん、ありがとう、リオ。最高だね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, that tracks."
msgstr "うん、それなら納得だ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, that."
msgstr "うん、それ。"

#. src: bundle
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, the customer decides, hun~"
msgstr "うん、お客さんが決めるのよ、ダーリン～"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, we should. It's been a while since we got to spend some time."
msgstr "うん、そうすべきだね。二人で過ごす時間が取れるの、久しぶりだし。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Yeah, we were moved down here when GAG was shifting people around after the Crisis... Guess that even included older ladies like me."
msgstr "うん、GAGが危機の後に人々を移動させた時、私たちもここに運ばれたの…私みたいな年配の女性も対象だったみたいね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, well they can GAG on my ass."
msgstr "ああ、じゃあ俺のケツにでもガムでも貼ってろよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah, well- Whatever. Are we good now?"
msgstr "うん、まあ…どうでもいいわ。これで、いいの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, well... Too late to worry about what if."
msgstr "うん、まあ……もしもを悩んでる場合じゃないよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, well... We'll see how the Cartel reacts to me coming back empty handed."
msgstr "うん、まあ…カテルが俺の空手帰りを見てどう反応するか、見ものだな。"

#. src: raw:MonoBehaviour
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, why not?"
msgstr "うん、なんでダメなの？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, yeah, whatever, I don't have time for you."
msgstr "うん、うん、どうでもいいわ。あなたにかまっている暇なんてないのよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, yeah. I'll be right back."
msgstr "うん、うん。すぐ戻るから。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, you got it Boss. See you then."
msgstr "はい、承知しました、ボス。ではまた。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah, you got me real good. Now about my pay..."
msgstr "うん、いいところ突かれたわね。じゃあ、給料の件だけど…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah, you're a lifesaver."
msgstr "うん、本当に助かったよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah- I uh- I guess I'll see what I can do. Thanks, Exxy."
msgstr "うん…ええと、できる範囲でやってみるわ。ありがとう、エクシー。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah- So I tracked down a new battery, but the guy who has it wants a picture of her boobs first... and I figured... I don't know..."
msgstr "うん…それで、新しいバッテリーを見つけ出したんだけど、それを持ってる男がまず彼女の胸の写真を要求してきて…それで、ええと…どうだろう…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah- they- mhm! Looks great!"
msgstr "うん——うん！すごくいい感じ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah. He was going on about something big coming. Kept saying to do what I'm told and keep my head down."
msgstr "うん。何か大きなことが起こるって、ずっと話してたんだ。言われた通りにして、目立たないようにしろって。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Yeah. I'll use that picture you gave me last time. It's gotten plenty of use already hehehe"
msgstr "うん。この前くれた写真、使わせてもらうよ。もう十分に使われてるけど、へへへ。（話し手：男）"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Yeah. It was a good life. Little extravagant for some, maybe... But for me, dear. It was just right."
msgstr "うん。良い人生だったわ。人によっては、ちょっと贅沢すぎたかもしれないけど……私にとっては、ちょうどよかったの。"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: <color=#EB83FF>Yeah. It's just like acting, I suppose.</color>
#. rich_translation: <color=#EB83FF>うん。演技みたいなもの、だと思う。</color>
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah. It's just like acting, I suppose."
msgstr "うん。演技みたいなもの、だと思う。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah. Just a flat"
msgstr "うん。ただのフラットな…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah. Let me explain..."
msgstr "うん。説明するわ…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah. Make the mouthy bitch yip."
msgstr "うん。口うるさいビッチに鳴かせてやれ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah. Sorry."
msgstr "うん。ごめん。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Klaudia"
msgid "Yeah. That's what I thought."
msgstr "うん。そう思ったわ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah. That's... that's true... Shit, this whole thing has been so scary."
msgstr "うん。それは…その通りだ…クソ、この状況、本当に怖かったよ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah. Well, it doesn't keep it from building up again. But once I used it, the itch was gone."
msgstr "うん。まあ、また溜まるのを防げるわけじゃないけど。でも一度使ったら、かゆみは消えたの。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Bunnyboy"
msgid "Yeah.. They were moved to 102 and I was sent to clean up.. Ugh.."
msgstr "うん…あいつら102号室に移動させられて、俺が後片付けさせられたんだ…うっ…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah.. Whats goin on back there..? I can't quite see."
msgstr "うん…あそこで何やってるの…？よく見えないんだけど。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "うん……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "うん…"

#. src: dialog
#. rich_text: Yeah... Draws attention from the-... <i>less</i> fun kind sometimes.
#. rich_translation: うん…たまに、ちょっと…面倒な目立つことになるんだ。
#, rt-review
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... Draws attention from the-... less fun kind sometimes."
msgstr "うん…たまに、ちょっと…面倒な目立つことになるんだ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah... Good thing we had a frame laying around... and a photo printer."
msgstr "うん……フレームが手元にあったのが幸いだったわ……それに、写真プリンターもね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... Good times..."
msgstr "うん…いい時間だったな…"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... I do... I mean- If you want... heh."
msgstr "うん……したい……って、もし君が望むなら……へへ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... I guess I'll need some more help from you then..."
msgstr "うん……じゃあ、もう少しあなたの助けが必要みたいね……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... I know the feeling... If it weren't for my friend Sarah... I would've been... well. Not in a great spot. Not that I'm in one now..."
msgstr "うん……その気持ち、わかるよ……もし友達のサラがいなかったら……俺は……まあ、今もそうだけど……大して良い状況じゃなかっただろうな……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... I was really scared when they started moving people into other cities. Glad they didn't do it to us."
msgstr "うん…人々を他の都市へ移し始めた時、本当に怖かった。私たちにはやらなかったのが幸いだったけど。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... I'm sorry about this, Max."
msgstr "うん……ごめんね、マックス。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah... I've heard of it."
msgstr "うん……聞いたことあるわ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... It's... I hate it..."
msgstr "うん……それは……嫌い……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... Just getting the elevator fixed up. It's really taking a while."
msgstr "うん…エレベーターを修理中なんだ。どうも時間がかかってるみたい。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah... Mine neither."
msgstr "うん…私も。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... Mood."
msgstr "うん…雰囲気ってやつ。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Leona"
msgid "Yeah... Right."
msgstr "うん…そうね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... Right..."
msgstr "ああ……そうね……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... Sure..."
msgstr "うん……わかったよ……"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... We could do that."
msgstr "うん……そうする手もあるね。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah... absolutely adorable."
msgstr "うん……最高に可愛い。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeah... right- so... speaking of other stuff... do you think you could show me how those massage chairs work?"
msgstr "うん……そうか……じゃあ……他の話といえば……そのマッサージチェアって、どうやって使うのか見せてくれない？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah? Watch your boney butt!"
msgstr "なんだ？その骨ばったお尻に気をつけろよ！"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah? What about them."
msgstr "なんだ？そいつらのことはどうなんだ？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah? What do you need?"
msgstr "なんだ？何が必要なんだ？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeah? Whatcha need?"
msgstr "なんだ？何の用だ？"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Yeahhh... Last one was kinda... well... let's just say she didn't follow the rules too closely."
msgstr "うーん……前の子はちょっと……まあ……ルールをあまり守ってなかった、とでも言っておこうかな。"

#. src: dialog
msgctxt "speaker:Zoey"
msgid "Yeahhh... She's quite the character."
msgstr "ううん…彼女はなかなかのキャラだね。"

#. src: dialog
